     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<img src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBZ2NNIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--b4d819802b8d2289d76f676b33b21d4b44465211/CS_Figure_07_04_019.jpg\" alt=\"A tree diagram with three stages. The tree diagram shows a node branching into three nodes labeled H, E, and S. The node, H branches into two nodes labeled A and B. Node, E leads to a node labeled C. Node, S branches into three nodes labeled J, K, and L. The possible outcomes are as follows: H A, H B, E C, S J, S K, and S L.\">"
